OL,3,AThe Gentlemen star Ray Winstone charms
OL,4,Alocals in Welsh market town
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn actor renowned for his "hard man"
OL,7,Fimage and London gangster roles looked
OL,8,Fat home filming on the more genteel
OL,9,Fstreets of a south Wales market town.
OL,11,FRay Winstone, recently seen in Guy
OL,12,FRitchie's The Gentlemen, as well as
OL,13,Fstar of The Departed and Sexy Beast,
OL,14,Fwas spotted in Cowbridge in the Vale of
OL,15,FGlamorgan, filming the six-part
OL,16,Faction-comedy Danger Money.
OL,18,FWinstone leads the cast as Alan "Razor"
OL,19,FSharp, an ex-SAS operative, with
OL,20,FCowbridge portraying a town in England.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
